        <object label="Proposed RTL datapath: 128-bit SRAM, direct capture, local sequencer" tooltip="Hardware proposal from the memory-bandwidth discussion. It does not modify the existing 32-bit/66-cycle C model. Colours/fonts and the main left-to-right layout follow this drawing." id="fEt4LbSzs0sntKll7tNw-111">
