        <object label="MAC11&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;W11 (stationary)&lt;/font&gt;" tooltip="Stationary signed INT8 weight captured directly from its fixed byte lane of SRAM Q on CAP_W. Registered x moves down; signed INT32 psum moves right. Cell update uses old neighbour values at its enabled compute edge. No per-cell AXI transaction, software load, or instruction decode." id="BZO00zG9JKyp_xtQwubo-8">
